==================================================
INGEST.PY RESPONSIBILITIES
==================================================

1. Load all .txt files from documents/
2. Read content
3. Split documents using RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter
4. Create embeddings
5. Store vectors in ChromaDB
6. Save database in vectordb/
7. Print indexing statistics

==================================================
APP.PY RESPONSIBILITIES
==================================================

1. Create Streamlit interface
2. Accept user questions
3. Connect to ChromaDB
4. Retrieve top 3 relevant chunks
5. Pass context to Gemma via Ollama API
6. Generate final response
7. Display answer
8. Display source document names
9. Display chat history

